FORE: "if_dne": false\nAFTER:  "if_dne": true\nREASON: Enable DNE feature for improved spatial adaptability\n```\n\n### 3. DNE Dimensionality\n```\nBEFORE: "mid_dim": 64\nAFTER:  "mid_dim": 128\nREASON: Proper dimensionality for DNE transformation\n```\n\n### 4. Input Window\n```\nBEFORE: (missing)\nAFTER:  "input_window": 12\nREASON: Explicit configuration, required by model\n```\n\n### 5. Time Intervals\n```\nBEFORE: (missing)\nAFTER:  "time_intervals": 300\nREASON: 5-minute intervals (standard LibCity resolution)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Current RSTIB Configuration\n```json\n{\n  "input_window": 12,\n  "output_window": 12,\n  "embed_dim": 64,\n  "num_layer": 2,\n  "node_dim": 64,\n  "temp_dim_tid": 64,\n  "temp_dim_diw": 64,\n  "if_spatial": true,\n  "if_time_in_day": true,\n  "if_day_in_week": true,\n  "if_dne": true,\n  "mid_dim": 128,\n  "info_beta": 0.001,\n  "learning_rate": 0.002,\n  "max_epoch": 300,\n  "train_loss": "masked_mae"\n}\n```\n\n### Compatible Datasets\n- METR_LA (207 nodes) - **Recommended for quick test**\n- PEMS_BAY (325 nodes) - **Recommended for comprehensive test**\n- PEMSD3, PEMSD4, PEMSD7, PEMSD8\n- LOOP_SEATTLE\n- T_DRIVE20150206\n\n### Expected Performance\n- METR_LA: MAE 2.5-3.0 (45-90 min training)\n- PEMS_BAY: MAE 1.5-2.0 (90-180 min training)\n\n---\n\n## File Locations\n\n### LibCity Configuration Files\n```\nBigscity-LibCity/\n└── libcity/\n    └── config/\n        ├── task_config.json (RSTIB registered at line 100, 508-512)\n        └── model/\n            └── traffic_state_pred/\n                └── RSTIB.json ✅ UPDATED\n```\n\n### LibCity Model Files\n```\nBigscity-LibCity/\n└── libcity/\n    └── model/\n        └── traffic_speed_prediction/\n            ├── __init__.py (RSTIB imported at line 31, exported at line 75)\n            └── RSTIB.py ✅ In place\n```\n\n### Documentation & Examples\n```\n/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/agentCity/\n├── RSTIB_EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY.md ✅ New\n├── RSTIB_MIGRATION_SUMMARY.md ✅ New