l lookback (1 hour at 5-min intervals) |\n| output_window | 12 | Prediction horizon (1 hour) |\n| embed_dim | 64 | Initial embedding dimension |\n| num_layer | 2 | MLP encoder layers |\n| node_dim | 64 | Spatial embedding dimension |\n| if_dne | true | Enable Dynamic Node Embeddings |\n| mid_dim | 128 | DNE intermediate dimension |\n| info_beta | 0.001 | Information Bottleneck weight |\n| learning_rate | 0.002 | Adam learning rate |\n| max_epoch | 300 | Maximum training epochs |\n\n---\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [x] Configuration files verified\n- [x] Model registration confirmed\n- [x] Hyperparameters validated against paper\n- [x] Dataset compatibility confirmed\n- [x] Example configurations created\n- [x] Documentation completed\n- [x] JSON syntax validated\n- [x] All files in place\n\n---\n\n## Support Resources\n\n### For Configuration Issues\n→ Check RSTIB_CONFIG_VERIFICATION_REPORT.md\n\n### For Dataset Questions\n→ Check RSTIB_DATASET_COMPATIBILITY.json\n\n### For Training Help\n→ Check RSTIB_MIGRATION_SUMMARY.md (Troubleshooting section)\n\n### For Verification\n→ Check RSTIB_CONFIGURATION_VERIFICATION_CHECKLIST.md\n\n### For Implementation Details\n→ Check RSTIB_CONFIG_VERIFICATION_REPORT.md (Technical section)\n\n---\n\n## Paper Reference\n\n**Title**: Information Bottleneck-guided MLPs for Robust Spatial-temporal Forecasting\n\n**Conference**: ICML 2025\n\n**Authors**: Chen et al.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/mchen644/RSTIB\n\n**Key Features**:\n- Information Bottleneck mechanism for robustness\n- MLP-based architecture (no graph convolutions)\n- Dynamic Node Embeddings for adaptability\n- Multi-scale temporal encoding\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. **Immediate** (Now)\n   - Read RSTIB_EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY.md\n   - Review configuration changes\n\n2. **Short-term** (1-2 hours)\n   - Run METR_LA validation\n   - Verify no errors\n   - Check output formats\n\n3. **Medium-term** (2-6 hours)\n   - Run PEMS_BAY comprehensive test\n   - Compare with b