[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] **Source Repository**: ./repos/STDMAE
[STDMAE:migration] **Target**: LibCity framework at Bigscity-LibCity
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] ## Key Information from Analysis:
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] **Model Architecture**:
[STDMAE:migration] - Main class: `STDMAE` in `./repos/STDMAE/stdmae/stdmae_arch/stdmae.py`
[STDMAE:migration] - Pre-training components: `Mask` (TMAE and SMAE) in `./repos/STDMAE/stdmae/stdmae_arch/mask/mask.py`
[STDMAE:migration] - Backend: `GraphWaveNet` in `./repos/STDMAE/stdmae/stdmae_arch/graphwavenet/model.py`
[STDMAE:migration] - Supporting modules: PatchEmbedding, MaskGenerator, TransformerLayers, PositionalEncoding
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] **Input/Output Format**:
[STDMAE:migration] - Input: history_data [B, L, N, 3], long_history_data [B, L*P, N, 3]
[STDMAE:migration] - L = 12 timesteps (short-term), L*P = 864 timesteps (long-term, 3 days)
[STDMAE:migration] - Output: [B, L, N, 1] predictions
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] **Critical Features**:
[STDMAE:migration] - Two-stage training: Pre-train TMAE/SMAE, then fine-tune with GraphWaveNet
[STDMAE:migration] - Pre-trained weights must be frozen during fine-tuning
[STDMAE:migration] - Requires adjacency matrix for graph operations
[STDMAE:migration] - Long-term history (864 timesteps) for MAE encoding
[STDMAE:migration] - Uses only first feature channel for MAE
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] ## Tasks:
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] 1. **Create Model File**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/STDMAE.py`
[STDMAE:migration]    - Inherit from `AbstractTrafficStateModel`
[STDMAE:migration]    - Implement `__init__(self, config, data_feature)`
[STDMAE:migration]    - Implement `forward(self, batch)` - handle batch format conversion
[STDMAE:migration]    - Implement `predict(self, batch)` - call forward
[STDMAE:migration]    - Implement `calculate_loss(self, batch)` - use masked MAE
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] 2. **Port All Required Modules**:
[STDMAE:migration]    - Copy and adapt Mask class (TMAE/SMAE)
[STDMAE:migration]    - Copy and adapt GraphWaveNet
[STDMAE:migration]    - Copy supporting modules (PatchEmbedding, etc.)
[STDMAE:migration]    - Ensure all imports work with LibCity structure
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] 3. **Handle Data Format Conversion**:
[STDMAE:migration]    - LibCity batch format: batch['X'], batch['y'], batch['X_ext']
[STDMAE:migration]    - Convert to STDMAE expected format (history_data, long_history_data)
[STDMAE:migration]    - Handle adjacency matrix from data_feature
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] 4. **Register Model**: Update `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/__init__.py` and appropriate task-specific `__init__.py`
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] 5. **Handle Pre-trained Weights**:
[STDMAE:migration]    - Ensure paths for loading TMAE/SMAE weights are configurable
[STDMAE:migration]    - Freeze pre-trained parameters during fine-tuning
[STDMAE:migration]    - Support both pre-training and fine-tuning modes
[STDMAE:migration] 
[STDMAE:migration] **Reference**: LibCity expects models at Bigscity-LibCity path to inherit AbstractTrafficStateModel with predict(), calculate_loss(), and forward() methods.
