/__init__.py`\n\n**Important Notes:**\n- Focus on STMLP (student) model as it's lightweight and doesn't require teacher distillation\n- Preserve the model architecture exactly as in original code\n- Use LibCity's standard scaler from data_feature\n- Follow LibCity conventions for batch handling and loss calculation\n\nPlease create the adapted model file and register it properly.", 'subagent_type': 'model-adapter'}
